## Incremental Verification

**After each task (not just at the end)**:

### TypeScript Check (Modified Files Only)
```powershell
pnpm exec tsc --noEmit path/to/file1.ts path/to/file2.ts
# Or full typecheck if many files
pnpm run typecheck
```

### Lint Check (Modified Files Only)
```powershell
pnpm exec eslint path/to/file1.ts path/to/file2.ts
# Or full lint
pnpm run lint
```

### Build Check (After All Tasks)
```powershell
pnpm run build
```

